                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A lovely light weight strategy game. I thoroughly enjoyed playing through the main campaign, and am so happy I finally found a solid tower defense game that isn't visually overwhelming (I love the strategy of tower defense, but most major tower defense games make my eyes feel like hopping right out of my skull.) I feel like it's a solid balance of challenging but complete-able. Two thumbs up!!",
